  "description": {
    "text": "The second of the yearly Happy Meal promotions Pokémon ran with McDonald's. From 15 June to 5 July 2012, each Pokémon Black•White Happy Meal in North America held one of these 12 cards, each with a McDonald's M foil stamp on its picture, and one of six figures: Pikachu, Axew, Dewott, Pignite, Servine and Woobat. Later in 2012 the promotion went on to other major markets, Europe and Canada among them.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Franchising.com: Pokémon-Themed Happy Meals Return to McDonald's Locations across North America (the 2012 press release)",
        "url": "https://www.franchising.com/amp/news/20120529_pokeacutemonthemed_happy_meals_return_to_mcdonaldr.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Purrloin (9/12, McDonald's 2012)",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/card/purrloin-9-12-mcdonalds-mcdonalds-collection/"
      }
    ]
  },
